{"sha": "58305a7431dd2ac6837ae9cc7583b90138f42addce41dbfaa043fadaf4c3693f", "body": ["\\section{优势区域图与分布图}", "", "\\begin{definition}[优势区域图与分布图]\\label{def:b1:predominant-reaction:predominance}", "对于酸碱共轭对 HA/A，$\\mathrm{pH} = \\mathrm{p}K_a + \\log([\\mathrm{A}]/[\\mathrm{HA}])$：", "酸占优势（$[\\mathrm{HA}] > [\\mathrm{A}]$）的区间为", "$\\mathrm{pH} < \\mathrm{p}K_a$，碱占优势的区间为 $\\mathrm{pH} > \\mathrm{p}K_a$。", "\\emph{优势区域图}\\index{优势区域图}是将 pH 轴", "在各 $\\mathrm{p}K_a$ 处分割成各形态占优势的区域。", "\\emph{分布图}\\index{分布图}", "给出各形态所占分数 $[\\text{形态}]/C$，随 pH 而变。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[亨德森关系与分数]\\label{prop:b1:predominant-reaction:henderson}", "设酸碱共轭对 HA/A 的总浓度为 $C = [\\mathrm{HA}] + [\\mathrm{A}]$，", "\\[", "  \\mathrm{pH} = \\mathrm{p}K_a + \\log\\frac{[\\mathrm{A}]}{[\\mathrm{HA}]}, \\qquad", "  \\frac{[\\mathrm{HA}]}{C} = \\frac{1}{1 + 10^{\\mathrm{pH} - \\mathrm{p}K_a}}, \\qquad", "  \\frac{[\\mathrm{A}]}{C} = \\frac{1}{1 + 10^{\\mathrm{p}K_a - \\mathrm{pH}}} .", "\\]", "当 pH 与 $\\mathrm{p}K_a$ 相差一个单位时，次要形态的占比低于", "总量的 10\\,\\%；相差两个单位时，低于 1\\,\\%。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对 $K_a = [\\mathrm{A}][\\ce{H3O+}]/[\\mathrm{HA}]$ 取对数，于是", "即 $[\\mathrm{A}]/[\\mathrm{HA}] = 10^{\\mathrm{pH}-\\mathrm{p}K_a}$，再将", "$[\\mathrm{HA}]$ 除以 $[\\mathrm{HA}] + [\\mathrm{A}]$ 即得分数。", "当 $\\mathrm{pH} = \\mathrm{p}K_a + 1$ 时，$[\\mathrm{HA}]/C = 1/11 < 10\\,\\%$；", "当 $+2$ 时，为 $1/101$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[name=e,", "  width=0.48\\linewidth, height=5.2cm, xmin=0, xmax=14, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={pH}, ylabel={分数},", "  xtick={0,2,4,6,8,10,12,14},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=pH, y=HA] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-distribution-diagrams-ethanoic.dat};", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=pH, y=A] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-distribution-diagrams-ethanoic.dat};", "\\draw[dotted] (axis cs:4.76,0) -- (axis cs:4.76,0.5);", "\\node[omDef, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.3,0.3) {\\ce{CH3COOH}};", "\\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=east] at (axis cs:13.7,0.3) {\\ce{CH3COO-}};", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:4.8,0.48) {4.76};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{axis}[at={(e.east)}, anchor=west, xshift=1.1cm,", "  width=0.48\\linewidth, height=5.2cm, xmin=0, xmax=14, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={pH}, ylabel={分数},", "  xtick={0,2,4,6,8,10,12,14},", "  legend style={font=\\scriptsize, draw=none, at={(0.5,1.04)}, anchor=south, legend columns=4},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=pH, y=H3A] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-distribution-diagrams-phosphoric.dat};", "\\addplot[omMeth, thick] table[x=pH, y=H2A] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-distribution-diagrams-phosphoric.dat};", "\\addplot[omProp, thick] table[x=pH, y=HA] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-distribution-diagrams-phosphoric.dat};", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=pH, y=A] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-distribution-diagrams-phosphoric.dat};", "\\legend{\\ce{H3PO4}, \\ce{H2PO4-}, \\ce{HPO4^{2-}}, \\ce{PO4^{3-}}}", "", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}]", "  \\draw[->, thick] (0,0) -- (14.2*0.85,0) node[right] {pH};", "  \\foreach \\x/\\l in {2.15/2.15, 7.21/7.21, 12.34/12.34}", "    \\draw (\\x*0.85,0.15) -- (\\x*0.85,-0.15) node[below] {\\l};", "  \\node[above] at (1.07*0.85,0.1) {\\ce{H3PO4}};", "  \\node[above] at (4.68*0.85,0.1) {\\ce{H2PO4-}};", "  \\node[above] at (9.78*0.85,0.1) {\\ce{HPO4^{2-}}};", "  \\node[above] at (13.3*0.85,0.1) {\\ce{PO4^{3-}}};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 乙酸（左）与磷酸", "（右）的分布图，以及磷酸的优势区域图。每两条相邻曲线的", "交点位于某个 $\\mathrm{p}K_a$ 处；两性物质", "\\ce{H2PO4-} 与 \\ce{HPO4^{2-}} 在各自区域中部几乎只以", "一种形态存在。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{优势反应法}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[酸碱反应的常数]\\label{prop:b1:predominant-reaction:k-of-reaction}", "酸碱共轭对中的酸 $\\mathrm{HA}_1$ 与另一共轭对中的碱", "$\\mathrm{A}_2$ 的反应，", "$\\mathrm{HA}_1 + \\mathrm{A}_2 \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{A}_1 + \\mathrm{HA}_2$,", "其常数为", "\\[", "  K = \\frac{K_{a1}}{K_{a2}} = 10^{\\,\\mathrm{p}K_{a2} - \\mathrm{p}K_{a1}} .", "\\]", "反应有利（$K > 1$），条件是所给的酸", "比其所生成的酸更强（$\\mathrm{p}K_{a1} < \\mathrm{p}K_{a2}$）；当", "按\\cref{met:b1:extent-q-and-k:quantitative}的意义，反应为定量反应，", "当 $\\mathrm{p}K_a$ 之差超过约 4 时。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "该反应是 $\\mathrm{HA}_1 + \\ce{H2O} \\rightleftharpoons", "\\mathrm{A}_1 + \\ce{H3O+}$（$K_{a1}$）与 $\\mathrm{HA}_2 +", "\\ce{H2O} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{A}_2 + \\ce{H3O+}$ 的逆反应（$1/K_{a2}$）之和；", "由\\cref{prop:b1:extent-q-and-k:combine-k}可得 $K = K_{a1}/K_{a2}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[优势反应与等效溶液]\\label{def:b1:predominant-reaction:predominant-reaction}", "在含有多种酸和碱的溶液中，", "\\emph{优势反应}\\index{优势反应}是平衡常数最大的反应，", "即溶液中存在的最强酸与最强碱之间的反应。若其为", "定量反应，则将其视为完全进行，并以", "\\emph{等效溶液}\\index{等效溶液}代替原溶液：即该反应完成后", "所得的溶液，其 pH 与", "原溶液相同。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}